---
import { getEntry, render } from 'astro:content';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
const entry = await getEntry('aiqna', 'methodology');
const { Content } = await render(entry!);
const { title, description, canonical } = entry!.data;
---
<Base title={title} description={description} canonicalUrl={canonical} robots="noindex, follow">
  <main class="archive">
    <a href="/">← AI Coachella Valley</a>
    <p class="eyebrow">Experimental archive · September 30, 2026</p>
    <h1>AIQnA</h1>
    <p class="intro">An experiment being reworked.</p>
    <p>The June 2026 pilot explored conversations about AI and daily life. Its documentation is retained here as an archive. There is no active weekly publication commitment or promised restart date.</p>
    <p>The example below is illustrative. Its counts, percentages and quotations are sample data, not real resident responses. They are not evidence for AICV reports.</p>
    <p><a href="/aiqna/2026-06-16-coachella-data-center-moratorium/">View the clearly labeled sample →</a></p>
    <details>
      <summary>Read the archived pilot design</summary>
      <div class="manuscript"><Content /></div>
    </details>
    <p>For active research, <a href="/reports/">read AICV reports</a> or <a href="/briefs/">browse the briefs</a>. Questions: <a href="mailto:sat@aicv.co">sat@aicv.co</a>.</p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
<style>
  .archive { max-width: 800px; padding: 3rem 1.5rem; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--pine-dark); }
  .archive h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 4rem); margin: 1rem 0; }
  .archive p { line-height: 1.7; margin: 1.25rem 0; }
  .archive a { color: var(--pine); text-decoration: underline; }
  .eyebrow { font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .intro { font-size: 1.4rem; }
  details { border: 1px solid var(--pine-light); border-radius: .5rem; padding: 1.25rem; margin: 2rem 0; }
  summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; }
  .manuscript { margin-top: 2rem; }
  .manuscript :global(p), .manuscript :global(li) { line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .manuscript :global(h2) { margin: 2rem 0 1rem; }
</style>
